[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l009","ordinal":151297,"en":"And drink our fill of joy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l010","ordinal":151298,"en":"While our tiger elder is present,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l011","ordinal":151299,"en":"Let us cough loudly together"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l012","ordinal":151300,"en":"And raise our downcast spirits!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l013","ordinal":151301,"en":"When you mounted a horse, you mounted indeed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l014","ordinal":151302,"en":"My elder, Prince Semetey—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l015","ordinal":151303,"en":"What horns have you suddenly grown?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l016","ordinal":151304,"en":"Your Akshunkar should alight"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l017","ordinal":151305,"en":"Upon the hands of these two;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l018","ordinal":151306,"en":"If you fly the falcon alone,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l019","ordinal":151307,"en":"You would need two heads!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l020","ordinal":151308,"en":"While the boys spoke in this way,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l021","ordinal":151309,"en":"The world lay level around them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l022","ordinal":151310,"en":"And the sea spread out like this;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l023","ordinal":151311,"en":"When one looked into its depths,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l024","ordinal":151312,"en":"It seemed broader than the face of the earth."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l025","ordinal":151313,"en":"He could not say of the falcon on his hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l026","ordinal":151314,"en":"“I will not give it,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l027","ordinal":151315,"en":"Nor turn away the brave man’s wish;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l028","ordinal":151316,"en":"The famous heir of Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l029","ordinal":151317,"en":"Handed over the falcon."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l030","ordinal":151318,"en":"Eager to fly it at the swan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l031","ordinal":151319,"en":"Kulchoro took it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l032","ordinal":151320,"en":"Steadied all his thoughts,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l033","ordinal":151321,"en":"And settled the white falcon on his hand."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l034","ordinal":151322,"en":"Taking the falcon, Kulchoro"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l035","ordinal":151323,"en":"Fastened and secured it again,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l036","ordinal":151324,"en":"Attached Akshunkar’s long leash"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l037","ordinal":151325,"en":"To the belt around his waist,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l038","ordinal":151326,"en":"Hurried Semetey onward,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0972:b004:l039","ordinal":151327,"en":"For he did not know the proper way to release it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l001","ordinal":151328,"en":"Not knowing the manner of how"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l002","ordinal":151329,"en":"One should approach the swan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l003","ordinal":151330,"en":"He came trotting with pounding hooves,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l004","ordinal":151331,"en":"Saying, “Let the swan fly away,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l005","ordinal":151332,"en":"And drove it into full view."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l006","ordinal":151333,"en":"Unable to contain his excitement,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l007","ordinal":151334,"en":"Semetey came riding up."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l008","ordinal":151335,"en":"Then Kulchoro spoke these words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l009","ordinal":151336,"en":"Uttering an uncanny thought no man could know:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l010","ordinal":151337,"en":"“Understand my precious words;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l011","ordinal":151338,"en":"Blessed elder, heed what I say!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l012","ordinal":151339,"en":"Let us not set the bird upon the swan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l013","ordinal":151340,"en":"And not drink our fill of joy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l014","ordinal":151341,"en":"I have looked upon this swan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l015","ordinal":151342,"en":"When it calls with that resonant cry,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l016","ordinal":151343,"en":"Its voice is unlike a swan’s."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l017","ordinal":151344,"en":"When it shakes itself like drifting sand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l018","ordinal":151345,"en":"Its form changes a thousand ways."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l019","ordinal":151346,"en":"It must be one of the spirits,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l020","ordinal":151347,"en":"The very embodiment of a sacred power."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l021","ordinal":151348,"en":"It has transformed itself into a swan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l022","ordinal":151349,"en":"My poor elder, hear my words:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l023","ordinal":151350,"en":"It is the source of some great calamity,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l024","ordinal":151351,"en":"A swan come from Mecca,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l025","ordinal":151352,"en":"And it has five young."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l026","ordinal":151353,"en":"Let us not bring it down for nothing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l027","ordinal":151354,"en":"And fall into its curse."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l028","ordinal":151355,"en":"Bloodthirsty elder, listen:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l029","ordinal":151356,"en":"If we fly a bird at this swan of omen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l030","ordinal":151357,"en":"It will bring shame upon us."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l031","ordinal":151358,"en":"This swan is no ordinary creature;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l032","ordinal":151359,"en":"It has a form resembling a human,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l033","ordinal":151360,"en":"Or else it may transform"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l034","ordinal":151361,"en":"And cast its demon upon us."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l035","ordinal":151362,"en":"It is a swan of wondrous power,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l036","ordinal":151363,"en":"One of the miracles!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l037","ordinal":151364,"en":"While the boy spoke in this way,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l038","ordinal":151365,"en":"The tiger swelled with daring,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b003:l039","ordinal":151366,"en":"And with a booming voice"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l001","ordinal":151367,"en":"Spoke to Kulchoro:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l002","ordinal":151368,"en":"“How much sin can there be in a swan?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l003","ordinal":151369,"en":"Boy, you have grown quite mad."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l004","ordinal":151370,"en":"For no good reason you hunger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l005","ordinal":151371,"en":"To say, ‘I shall fly the bird.’"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l006","ordinal":151372,"en":"Though still a boy yourself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l007","ordinal":151373,"en":"You stand there like a bakshy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l008","ordinal":151374,"en":"Reciting every omen;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l009","ordinal":151375,"en":"You have become a fine one indeed."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l010","ordinal":151376,"en":"Taking omens from things that do not exist,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l011","ordinal":151377,"en":"You have frightened yourself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l012","ordinal":151378,"en":"Muttering so many words"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l013","ordinal":151379,"en":"That you bar my way."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l014","ordinal":151380,"en":"If it is a swan come from Mecca,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l015","ordinal":151381,"en":"If it has five young,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l016","ordinal":151382,"en":"Let it face me and swallow me;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l017","ordinal":151383,"en":"If it is a swan of wondrous power,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l018","ordinal":151384,"en":"Let it kill me outright."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l019","ordinal":151385,"en":"Is there sin in taking a swan?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l020","ordinal":151386,"en":"Can one prosper by fearing a bird?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l021","ordinal":151387,"en":"Can the sin of killing a swan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l022","ordinal":151388,"en":"Be greater than that of killing a man?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l023","ordinal":151389,"en":"When I had reached the age of twelve,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l024","ordinal":151390,"en":"There in the fortress of Bukhara,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l025","ordinal":151391,"en":"When my father Temir Khan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l026","ordinal":151392,"en":"Agreed to what I asked,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l027","ordinal":151393,"en":"And held the funeral feast for my father Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l028","ordinal":151394,"en":"I began my feats of destruction:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l029","ordinal":151395,"en":"I tore one arm completely"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l030","ordinal":151396,"en":"From the camel-strong wrestler."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l031","ordinal":151397,"en":"Where then was my death?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l032","ordinal":151398,"en":"Where did sin overtake me?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l033","ordinal":151399,"en":"When I migrated to Talas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l034","ordinal":151400,"en":"I loaded my cartridge pouch and fired,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l035","ordinal":151401,"en":"And among the Kokand champions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l036","ordinal":151402,"en":"Beginning with Janaaly and Karach,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l037","ordinal":151403,"en":"I devoured them all without remainder."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l038","ordinal":151404,"en":"Where then was my death?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0973:b004:l039","ordinal":151405,"en":"Where did sin overtake me?”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l001","ordinal":151406,"en":"I bloodied the deep-flowing river;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l002","ordinal":151407,"en":"When my quarrel came upon me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l003","ordinal":151408,"en":"I laid low my own father."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l004","ordinal":151409,"en":"I bloodied my white blade;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l005","ordinal":151410,"en":"When my anger truly rose,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l006","ordinal":151411,"en":"I laid Abyke low."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l007","ordinal":151412,"en":"I bloodied my blue-steel blade;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l008","ordinal":151413,"en":"When my great fury came upon me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l009","ordinal":151414,"en":"I laid Khan Köbösh low."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l010","ordinal":151415,"en":"I slaughtered the forty choros,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l011","ordinal":151416,"en":"And slaughtered them for what they had done."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l012","ordinal":151417,"en":"I burned the rolling country,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l013","ordinal":151418,"en":"And set the grassy land aflame."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l014","ordinal":151419,"en":"I poured blood into the dark water—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l015","ordinal":151420,"en":"Where then was my death?”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l016","ordinal":151421,"en":"The dear lion raged,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l017","ordinal":151422,"en":"The renowned hero left as an heir"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l018","ordinal":151423,"en":"By the blue-maned champion Manas;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l019","ordinal":151424,"en":"His anger now rose unchecked,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l020","ordinal":151425,"en":"And he tore the falcon from Kulchoro’s hand."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l021","ordinal":151426,"en":"When the precious leash braided by Kanykey"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l022","ordinal":151427,"en":"Was pulled taut as the level sea,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l023","ordinal":151428,"en":"One half of that leash snapped"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l024","ordinal":151429,"en":"And remained with Kulchoro;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l025","ordinal":151430,"en":"Your swaggering madman"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l026","ordinal":151431,"en":"Wrenched the falcon away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l027","ordinal":151432,"en":"He swept off its hood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l028","ordinal":151433,"en":"And showed it the white swan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l029","ordinal":151434,"en":"Water streamed from its nostrils,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l030","ordinal":151435,"en":"Its throat feathers bristled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l031","ordinal":151436,"en":"It toppled and cried harshly,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l032","ordinal":151437,"en":"Struggled and flashed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l033","ordinal":151438,"en":"And would not remain upon the hand."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l034","ordinal":151439,"en":"Your madman’s falcon"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l035","ordinal":151440,"en":"Surged forward, unaware it might die;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l036","ordinal":151441,"en":"And your prince himself as well,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l037","ordinal":151442,"en":"Before it reached the intended place,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l038","ordinal":151443,"en":"Had made it distraught,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b003:l039","ordinal":151444,"en":"Waving it toward one side,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l001","ordinal":151445,"en":"Pushing it toward the other."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l002","ordinal":151446,"en":"His temples tightened with fury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l003","ordinal":151447,"en":"And Semetey, brave son of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l004","ordinal":151448,"en":"Struggled with Akshunkar."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l005","ordinal":151449,"en":"“It has reached the very height of its form,” he said;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l006","ordinal":151450,"en":"“It has stood pent up for many days"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l007","ordinal":151451,"en":"And wholly passed beyond its proper form,” he said."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l008","ordinal":151452,"en":"Driving it onward without tiring,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l009","ordinal":151453,"en":"Thinking it might strike a stone,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l010","ordinal":151454,"en":"He pulled the mouth of tireless Buurul"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l011","ordinal":151455,"en":"And turned the horse around."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l012","ordinal":151456,"en":"“Go, wondrous creature,” he said;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l013","ordinal":151457,"en":"“Put all your strength into it,” he said,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l014","ordinal":151458,"en":"And raised the bucket-sized falcon"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l015","ordinal":151459,"en":"Before hurling it aloft."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l016","ordinal":151460,"en":"Your noble Akshunkar"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l017","ordinal":151461,"en":"Shot from the glove like an arrow;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l018","ordinal":151462,"en":"The blue-maned hero’s falcon"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l019","ordinal":151463,"en":"Rose and set itself on course,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l020","ordinal":151464,"en":"Soon seeming lost from sight."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l021","ordinal":151465,"en":"It circled and hovered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l022","ordinal":151466,"en":"Banked backward in flight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l023","ordinal":151467,"en":"And beat its wings."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l024","ordinal":151468,"en":"When the madman’s falcon"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l025","ordinal":151469,"en":"Caught sight of the swan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l026","ordinal":151470,"en":"It thundered till ears went deaf,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l027","ordinal":151471,"en":"And roared as though no bigger than a fist."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l028","ordinal":151472,"en":"It reached the tent-sized white swan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l029","ordinal":151473,"en":"Before an arrow could,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l030","ordinal":151474,"en":"Drove that swan down against the earth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l031","ordinal":151475,"en":"And struck it as it swept past."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l032","ordinal":151476,"en":"Dust flew and feathers billowed;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l033","ordinal":151477,"en":"When Akshunkar struck it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l034","ordinal":151478,"en":"Its cry was heard in the heavens."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l035","ordinal":151479,"en":"The tent-sized white swan’s"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l036","ordinal":151480,"en":"Head plunged into the mud;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l037","ordinal":151481,"en":"Its strength failed as it staggered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l038","ordinal":151482,"en":"And it crawled toward the gray reeds,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0974:b004:l039","ordinal":151483,"en":"Calling “Kukulook!” as it floundered,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l001","ordinal":151484,"en":"Its strength gone, it waddled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l002","ordinal":151485,"en":"And that white swan stood exhausted."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l003","ordinal":151486,"en":"Semetey’s great war drum,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l004","ordinal":151487,"en":"Covered in waist hide—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l005","ordinal":151488,"en":"The mighty drum was made to resound perfectly;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l006","ordinal":151489,"en":"Was it not Bölekbay’s skill"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l007","ordinal":151490,"en":"That fashioned the mighty drum so well?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l008","ordinal":151491,"en":"When it was struck in the central land,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l009","ordinal":151492,"en":"Its blow could truly carry"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l010","ordinal":151493,"en":"Across a journey of six days."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l011","ordinal":151494,"en":"When the war drum was beaten hard,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l012","ordinal":151495,"en":"The earth split with its rumbling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l013","ordinal":151496,"en":"And the mountains echoed and roared."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l014","ordinal":151497,"en":"The leopard struck the war drum;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l015","ordinal":151498,"en":"In the marshes of Ala-Köl,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l016","ordinal":151499,"en":"While the tiger’s Akshunkar"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l017","ordinal":151500,"en":"Fought with the white swan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l018","ordinal":151501,"en":"And remained locked in struggle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l019","ordinal":151502,"en":"He shouted, “Manas! Manas!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l020","ordinal":151503,"en":"And raised the battle cry of Manas."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l021","ordinal":151504,"en":"Overcome with joy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l022","ordinal":151505,"en":"He pleaded with the two boys beside him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l023","ordinal":151506,"en":"Calling, “Hurry and reach it!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l024","ordinal":151507,"en":"Kulchoro and Kanchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l025","ordinal":151508,"en":"My two equal supports,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l026","ordinal":151509,"en":"You two, my younger brothers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l027","ordinal":151510,"en":"Reach it before an arrow could;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l028","ordinal":151511,"en":"Get there and cut its throat."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l029","ordinal":151512,"en":"Bind it securely again"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l030","ordinal":151513,"en":"And fasten it to the saddle straps."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l031","ordinal":151514,"en":"Slaughter it lawfully,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l032","ordinal":151515,"en":"And take it as a gift"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l033","ordinal":151516,"en":"To my dear mother Kanykey!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l034","ordinal":151517,"en":"After the falcon took it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l035","ordinal":151518,"en":"Kulchoro and Kanchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l036","ordinal":151519,"en":"The two choros, raced each other,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l037","ordinal":151520,"en":"Their stirrups striking together."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l038","ordinal":151521,"en":"Before they could reach the swan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b003:l039","ordinal":151522,"en":"Wearing his handsome patterned coat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l001","ordinal":151523,"en":"Semetey, brave son of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l002","ordinal":151524,"en":"Thundered along the road."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l003","ordinal":151525,"en":"He made his neck turn like a stag’s;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l004","ordinal":151526,"en":"Buurul was a true courser,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l005","ordinal":151527,"en":"And when game appeared along its path,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l006","ordinal":151528,"en":"It sprang without delay."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l007","ordinal":151529,"en":"He charged straight toward the swan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l008","ordinal":151530,"en":"Poor Buurul’s hoofbeats"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l009","ordinal":151531,"en":"Shattered the ground beneath him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l010","ordinal":151532,"en":"And he flew roaring like a cloud."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l011","ordinal":151533,"en":"Before one could say this or that,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l012","ordinal":151534,"en":"In the time it takes to blink,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l013","ordinal":151535,"en":"Semetey arrived like a master."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l014","ordinal":151536,"en":"He had gone the length of a spear,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l015","ordinal":151537,"en":"Keeping his eyes fixed on the white swan."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l016","ordinal":151538,"en":"Wondrous Akshunkar lay there,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l017","ordinal":151539,"en":"Clinging to the white swan’s neck;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l018","ordinal":151540,"en":"The white swan lay thrashing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l019","ordinal":151541,"en":"Locked in battle with Akshunkar."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l020","ordinal":151542,"en":"Raging, he made a sudden move,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l021","ordinal":151543,"en":"From tireless Buurul"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l022","ordinal":151544,"en":"He sprang and leapt down."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l023","ordinal":151545,"en":"The swan fled, and the falcon was gone;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l024","ordinal":151546,"en":"When Semetey opened his eyes,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l025","ordinal":151547,"en":"Such is the worthlessness of this world."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l026","ordinal":151548,"en":"He saw the swan crawling away;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l027","ordinal":151549,"en":"The blue-maned tiger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l028","ordinal":151550,"en":"Reached out his hand to seize it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l029","ordinal":151551,"en":"But caught the joint of its wing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p0975:b004:l030","ordinal":151552,"en":"With an unsteady grip."}]
